# MY LIFE OS — DevOps Roadmap

## 1. Purpose

MY LIFE OS is not only a personal application.

It is also a long-term DevOps learning and portfolio project.

The goal is to learn DevOps by building, deploying, monitoring and securing a real application.

The project should demonstrate practical understanding rather than simply listing technologies on a resume.

---

# 2. DevOps Philosophy

The project will follow:

```text
BUILD
  ↓
UNDERSTAND
  ↓
TEST
  ↓
IMPROVE
  ↓
NEXT
```

Each technology should solve a real project problem.

We should not add technology only because it is popular.

---

# 3. Starting Architecture

Initial architecture:

```text
Flutter
   ↓
FastAPI
   ↓
PostgreSQL
```

This will initially run locally.

The first goal is to make the application work correctly before introducing advanced infrastructure.

