# 10. Phase 6 — Docker

## Goal

Package the application into containers.

Without Docker:

```text
Install Python
Install PostgreSQL
Install dependencies
Configure environment
Run application
```

With Docker:

```text
Application
   ↓
Container
```

A container provides a consistent environment for running the application.

---

