# 26. DevOps Skill Levels

Each technology should progress through:

```text
Level 1 — Understand

Know what it is and why it exists.

Level 2 — Use

Use it in MY LIFE OS.

Level 3 — Troubleshoot

Fix common failures.

Level 4 — Explain

Explain it clearly in an interview.

Level 5 — Design

Understand where and why it should be used in a real architecture.
```

A technology should not be considered mastered simply because code was copied from an AI tool.

